# Costume Closet: "This artifact enters with two +1/+1 counters on it. {T}: Move a +1/+1 counter from this artifact onto target creature you
# control. Activate only as a sorcery. Whenever a modified creature you control leaves the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on this
# artifact." Bot1 casts it (two counters), then moves one onto its Ornithopter (one left, and the Ornithopter is a modified 1/3, CR 700.9).
# On turn 2 Bot2 exiles the Ornithopter with Swords to Plowshares: it left the battlefield modified (CR 603.10a), so the Closet gets a
# counter back (CR 122.1) and has two again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Costume Closet
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swords to Plowshares
Plains x20

