Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Costume Closet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Costume Closet.Activate(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Costume Closet.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
